OL,3,GNEWSASafety advice shared ahead of
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders are being reminded of the
OL,7,Frules around fires and fireworks as
OL,8,Fpart of Bonfire Night celebrations.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said public
OL,11,Fbonfires could be held between Tuesday
OL,12,Fand Saturday next week with schools,
OL,13,Fsports clubs and scouts groups all
OL,14,Fplanning to host events.
OL,16,FIt reminded people planning smaller
OL,17,Fgatherings that fires must be limited
OL,18,Fto clean wood and dry garden vegetation
OL,19,Fand bonfires must not be used to
OL,20,Fdispose of waste materials or produce
OL,21,Fdark smoke.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
