OL,3,GNEWSASafety advice shared ahead of
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers were asked to register
OL,7,Fevents with the States so neighbours,
OL,8,Fpet owners and others who may be
OL,9,Faffected by noise were aware.
